        "created_at": "2021-07-19T23:31:55.570Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like it! Thanks, this is what I was hoping for when I posted this. While I’ve run Sentinels before, it was in a non-traditional group (1 player, 2 NPCs that were controlled by the player) and while that gave me a good understanding of some of the rules, it wasn’t everything. Also, I’m not usually one for home-brew, but I decided to give it a go.</p>",
